{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/021042dca92365e05801bc30a553adc1.poster.avif?t=1759995631\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/021042dca92365e05801bc30a553adc1.webm?t=1759995631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/021042dca92365e05801bc30a553adc1.mp4?t=1759995631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a hotel overrun by monsters, with <strong>no memory of who you are.</strong><br>Whispers in your head say <i><strong>you</strong></i><strong> caused the outbreak.</strong><br>The survivors are hiding something\u2014and so are you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember the truth.</strong><br><strong>Save</strong> them... or <strong>Kill</strong> them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/f099e2ce16ef82e2475c3921eba1b3d1.poster.avif?t=1759995631\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/f099e2ce16ef82e2475c3921eba1b3d1.webm?t=1759995631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/f099e2ce16ef82e2475c3921eba1b3d1.mp4?t=1759995631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;For Zekyll&gt; is a new genre of immersive horror game that combines first-person horror thriller and Story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The conversation with the NPC and the progression of the main event are carried out in a sensory story format.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/8d99c388fc0768e45fa605f99201ed7a.poster.avif?t=1759995631\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/8d99c388fc0768e45fa605f99201ed7a.webm?t=1759995631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/8d99c388fc0768e45fa605f99201ed7a.mp4?t=1759995631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement and exploration are based on a first-person perspective.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The spacious four-story hotel is the game's main stage and features a detailed map design with various interactions, parking lots, power plants, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/4214a5b530125cc73912caada0d18b69.poster.avif?t=1759995631\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/4214a5b530125cc73912caada0d18b69.webm?t=1759995631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/4214a5b530125cc73912caada0d18b69.mp4?t=1759995631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The multiple endings and intense plot twists through the Karma-System that changes depending on the player's choices will be a big attraction of this game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the story by becoming the villain who leads them to destruction or the savior who saves them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/2515094cd9cbcf0ef279c6b692c416ca.avif?t=1759995631\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras_big/2515094cd9cbcf0ef279c6b692c416ca.avif?t=1759995631 width=800 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO AI</strong>  <br>No AI was used at all in BGM, 2D illustrations, SFX, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ending Story</strong><br>Includes full CG illustration cutscenes for 6+ endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person and immersive story</strong>  <br>Feel the harmony of tension and charming NPCs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857650?t=1759995631","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/0980b620bd9843bc4d0db71628490da6481fb631/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759995631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/d42ee4e60f6de65f09c7e88e5a4fae0ddabc0e21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759995631","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/d42ee4e60f6de65f09c7e88e5a4fae0ddabc0e21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759995631","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls